8700K CPU @ 3.70GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDue to the new \"All Recognized\" entry in native FileDialogs after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99266 there is now an off-by-one in the logic for adding file extension.\n\nExample: create a \"Save file\" filedialog. Set filters property to\n\n```\n*.foo,*.bar;Foo\n*.txt,*.doc;Text\n```\n\nso the native filedialog has following dropdown items in filter\n\n```\nAll Recognized (*.foo,*.bar,*.txt,*.doc)\nFoo (*.foo,*.bar)\nText (*.txt,*.doc)\nAll Files (*) (*.*)\n```\n\n(btw the `(*) (*.*)` rendering like that in the All Files feels like a bug as well)\n\nOpen the file dialog and experiment with filters and filename:\n\n- Selecting `All Recognized` and typing `test.txt` into the filename textfield results in `file_selected` to emit `test.txt.foo`\n- Selecting `Foo` and typing `test.foo` into textfield results in `file_selected` to emit `test.foo.txt`\n- Selecting `Text` allows for *any* file extension to be valid\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee above.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[auto-file-extension-native-dialogs.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17882069/auto-file-extension-native-dialogs.zip)\n\nIt opens a dialog every second so you can try different file name, filter selections and see the result in an alert dialog.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99591/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}